7-lang/NewChanlun/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/deployments","created_at":"2026-02-05T06:42:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T02:49:40Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-18T03:25:42Z","git_url":"git://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun","homepage":null,"size":541828,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":228,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":true,"web_commit_signoff_required":true,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"collaborators_only","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":1,"open_issues":228,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"Part of [TB-02 验收汇总：全部结构分类及构造子义务（SPEC #1340）](https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/issues/1360)；[已批准SPEC #1340](https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/issues/1340)，完整目标保持 #1323 六Destination。\n\n内部执行单元 `TB-02-D`。一票一实施会话，独立评审接回后再按交付门验收。\n\n## 要交付的外部行为\n\n在完整已知前缀或已有有效终结证据的具名输入上，实际形成第二特征序列、strict封闭和带缺口终结，保笔破坏/段破坏各自事实。\n\n## 验收条件\n\n- [ ] 第二序列取正确同向笔、接受规定分型；独立包含作用域和strict封闭按已裁语义。\n- [ ] 只使用完整已知前缀或已有有效终结证据的输入；不设置新扫描cap，不以预算耗尽或尚未发现代穷尽否定。\n- [ ] 笔破坏与段破坏按各自对象并存；一般扫描窗口、超50及continuation由TB-02-W完成。\n- [ ] 通过正式会话入口运行本片非真空输入；读取公共查询/变化并在浏览器核对新对象、变化和证据，不能仅直调内部函数或渲染假数据。\n- [ ] 以独立定义/裁定工作例或场所夹具独立账簿为 oracle；同输入新进程重放和所改持久边界恢复对拍，既有无关通过项不重复扩测。\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- [[impl] TB-02-C 线段 seed 与第一种终结（SPEC #1340）](https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/issues/1404)\n- [TB-01 验收汇总：正式结构和只读观察（SPEC #1340）](https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/issues/1359)\n\n依赖是完成本片必需成功结果的真实前置；只读备料和不消费该前置的准备可继续。自己的TB父票是验收汇总，不作为本片blocker。\n\n## 局部成功门\n\n- [[grilling] 第二特征序列扫描域与 continuation 边界（#1323，G-007）](https://github.com/xy7365527-lang/NewChanlun/issues/1344)：扫描窗口/51项以上/预算continuation与恢复一般实例，由TB-02-W承接；本片可独立完成：本叶已裁有限完整证据域\n\n## 证明与销项范围\n\n第二种终结与本前缀完整扫描，不替代 TB07 全历史恢复。；原父域交叉引用的经济/故障/观察条目只承担本片真实行为可给出的证据因子，完整条目按本文件parent_contribution_ledger留待所有原域共同完成。\n\n复用 TB01 已完成的身份/规范字节/切面/游标共同合同；本片只新增实际生产者或经济结果的绑定与差异验收，不另造同名类型。\n\n- 本片规划不证明当前已实装或可达；仅文档映射。\n- 某 A 或故事有多片/跨 TB 成功条款时，当前子义务通过不使原条目整项通过。\n- TestOnly 数量或受控场所顺序只证明具名协议试验域，不成为生产资金政策或完整历史经营模型。\n\n同父其余执行片、跨域实际消费/历史/场所/生产退役及最终独评仍按原 crosswalk 保留。\n\n## 已签来源与子义务映射\n\n下列ID只定位上文行为对应的子义务，完整定义、量词与跨域闭合仍由原SPEC/crosswalk持有。任何已裁/待证标签不自动生成排程边；正确拒绝、空实例、schema存在不能替代必需成功实例。\n\n- family：`AC-02, AC-03, CC-012, CC-013, CC-014, G-005, G-006, G-007, LC-02, OB-001, OB-002, OB-003, OB-004, OB-005, OB-006, OB-007, OB-008, OB-009, OB-010, OB-013, OB-015, OB-016, OB-017, OB-018, OB-019, OB-020, ST-007, ST-008, ST-048`\n- 细项验收：`A-CC-012-01, A-CC-012-02, A-CC-012-03, A-CC-012-04, A-CC-013-01, A-CC-013-02, A-CC-013-03, A-CC-013-04, A-CC-014-01, A-CC-014-02, A-CC-014-03, A-CC-014-04, A-LC-02-01, A-LC-02-02, A-OB-001-01, A-OB-002-01, A-OB-003-01, A-OB-004-01, A-OB-005-01, A-OB-006-01, A-OB-007-01, A-OB-008-01, A-OB-009-01, A-OB-0